        "type": "writing",
        "title": "The chart below shows the numbers of registered road vehicles in use in a European country in 1996 and 2006. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant. ",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N4pJd9ox0oxzVux3dU9lsivsgIe\"><strong><em>The chart below shows the numbers of registered road vehicles in use in a European country in 1996 and 2006. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</em></strong></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Registered Road Vehicles: 1996 vs 2006</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TqPldEHP5oO9Eqxr2kRlefpxgtb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QqQ9di0GboUYiyxGwfUlkpcUgYf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Registered Road Vehicles: 1996 vs 2006 y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả&nbsp;<strong>số lượng c&aacute;c loại xe kh&aacute;c nhau được đăng k&yacute; ở một nước ch&acirc;u &Acirc;u v&agrave;o 1996 v&agrave; 2006</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Dl46dMhdWoaFcyx0DMllnI2WgAh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch<a href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuyet-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\"> <strong><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">tả số liệu 'tuyệt đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</span></strong></a> trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ld9ad1GA1oSk36xU6CzlJFpdgzb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Registered Road Vehicles: 1996 vs 2006 với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: <strong>số lượng xe được đăng k&yacute; - nhiều loại xe - một nước ch&acirc;u &Acirc;u - 1996 v&agrave; 2006</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IFf1dMjRDok8HtxlXSUlI37OgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QZuWdhvTyoJJNVxWwVAljRgBgHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UKrndYlcBo1XInxIsA6lZRsmg4f\">Theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VWWWdCUrmoEuebxKhfclmOiQg3c\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends: </strong>private cars v&agrave; other types tăng, c&ograve;n lại kh&aacute; ổn định</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E3Fdd0i5MoKT5cxqdkYlTwsJg6f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences: </strong>private cars v&agrave; other types cao nhất</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P06AdwVAioetUFx6MzilxCvvgvf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Iw8edtlqto6Jj7xtbLbli7Whgrg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Private car v&agrave; other types</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FGoFdrX3foMqK8xZJJalqfVZgZe\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DbPqdljc9oPQoXx0MHdlvn1UgHe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1996 </strong><em>(private cars l&agrave; 19 million, </em><span style=\"color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><em><strong>gấp mười</strong></em></span><em> other types)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cdm7dhmDyoG0crxe4jHl2Q3wgye\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của private cars </strong><em>(</em><span style=\"color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><em><strong>tăng mạnh</strong></em></span><em> </em><em>tới 24 million v&agrave;o 2006)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-USqud13uwoFu3WxAS3KlzUDZgeh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của other types </strong><em>(</em><span style=\"color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><em><strong>tăng nhẹ</strong></em></span><em>, từ 1 million tới 2 million v&agrave;o 2006)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HKUodfK9xogC0MxTp2Wlp70ng9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PbgHdRg6QoFNP2xJjBqlPpMBgYg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PUFAdVcVuozUOkxgG1Sla1WNgOZ\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: Lorries, bus v&agrave; motorcycles</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PUFAdVcVuozUOkxgG1Sla1WNgOZ\">\n<div data-lark-html-role=\"root\"><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"33\">Theo </span><strong><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"34\">Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></span></strong><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"35\">, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</span></div>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-H92wd7WL0oS7g8xPYitlRQKhgUc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1996 </strong><em>(lorries v&agrave; motocycles c&oacute; số liệu giống nhau khoảng 1 million)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LoPyd7BzToucMSxiRgqlUuICgZi\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của private lorries v&agrave; motorcycles </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>giảm nhẹ </strong></em><em>c&ograve;n motorcycles</em><em><strong> tăng nhẹ </strong></em><em>)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I3I8dslAcohrv1xwR0elBtEkgvf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>số liệu v&agrave; xu hướng của buses </strong><em>(cả 2 năm</em><em><strong> đều thấp nhất, </strong></em><em>khoảng 0.5 million)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RuxRdF0GuoF09YxnotEl2yn7gbj\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TN6Fd9B0PohTNjxAWltlSG3sgUg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MHsHd6xHMopW2kxzOkzlYB28g4e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Cụm từ&nbsp;<strong>\"registered vehicles\"</strong> c&oacute; thể hơi kh&oacute; để d&ugrave;ng từ đồng nghĩa v&igrave; c&oacute; thể sẽ mất đi t&iacute;nh ch&iacute;nh x&aacute;c, thay v&agrave;o đ&oacute; m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng dạng noun của register v&agrave; biến n&oacute; th&agrave;nh <strong>\"vehicles with registration\"</strong> nha.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XiRXdHMCloZKVVxvimdlLyNsgmb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I9HydiQDwovqzWxaPcdl88thgch\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Private cars dominated the statistics with approximately 19 million vehicles with registration in 1996.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 403,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction ",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N4pJd9ox0oxzVux3dU9lsivsgIe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QzhhdKXfnou1TVxCAbElv7HQgjb\">The bar chart illustrates the number of registered vehicles of different types in a European country in 1996 and 2006.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13788,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 404,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DY7HdPEImooKCTxmAHllDuIQgIe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S9rKdxceKo77UFxA5uSlobMegYb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S9rKdxceKo77UFxA5uSlobMegYb\">Overall, private cars and other types were by far the most common type of vehicle in both years, with their numbers showing a substantial increase over the period. Meanwhile, the figures for other categories remained relatively stable at much lower levels.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13788,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 405,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RhzodfQIqocQyOxAyW2lkbnngxg\">Looking at the two most numerous categories, private cars dominated the statistics with approximately 19 million vehicles with registration in 1996, around ten times as high as other types of vehicles' number. The figure for private cars then rose markedly to 24 million by 2006. Similarly, other types of vehicles saw a slight increase from about 1 million to 2 million over the same timeframe.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13788,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 406,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FNg9dfnFdoicTWxXw5nlpJbygxc\">Regarding the remaining categories, both lorries and motorcycles had similar figures of around 1 million vehicles in 1996, though lorries experienced a minor decline while motorcycles showed a slight decrease by 2006. Buses consistently recorded the lowest numbers, with less than 0.5 million vehicles in both years.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13788,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
